   "end_ms": 13320,
   "text": "But where is everyone else?"
  },
  {
   "start_ms": 16200,
   "end_ms": 19060,
   "text": "Well, our family had a huge falling out because of you."
  },
  {
   "start_ms": 19600,
   "end_ms": 21580,
   "text": "What to do with you while you were in a coma."
  },
  {
   "start_ms": 22000,
   "end_ms": 23520,
   "text": "And let me tell you, it wasn't cheap."
  },
  {
   "start_ms": 24860,
   "end_ms": 27820,
   "text": "My mom said she didn't want to see you."
