   "text": "Wargrant Slagger!"
  },
  {
   "start_ms": 75960,
   "end_ms": 76960,
   "text": "So I brought some documents for you to sign."
  },
  {
   "start_ms": 76960,
   "end_ms": 77960,
   "text": "And after that, they're going to send you somewhere to help you get back on your feet."
