   "text": "Whoa, awesome! Wait, how are you doing that?"
  },
  {
   "start_ms": 128000,
   "end_ms": 129000,
   "text": "It's nothing."
  },
  {
   "start_ms": 129000,
   "end_ms": 131000,
   "text": "I want to know if Sega won the console wars."
  },
  {
   "start_ms": 132000,
   "end_ms": 135000,
   "text": "Huh? Sega? Now?"
  },
  {
   "start_ms": 136000,
   "end_ms": 140000,
   "text": "Well, these days, Sony and Nintendo are the biggest console makers."
  },
  {
   "start_ms": 141000,
   "end_ms": 142000,
   "text": "Huh? No Sega?"
  },
  {
